Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 01:36:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] lazarus: nta-signer, the reference NTA signer for payees
 without a gateway

SOV-017. Follows any node's tip over RPC (waitfornewblock long-poll, polling
fallback), takes the next block's bits from getmininginfo.next / GBT / regtest
header, signs each new tip for every key and posts to Prime's POST /nta/attest
(one retry on 409). Key files are mode 600, refused otherwise, never logged.
bip86-tweak writes the output key's secret d+t (BIP341 key-path vector test).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
